OL,3,GNEWSATrio bag ultra-marathon's first
OL,4,Awomen-only UK podium
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree women scooped the top spots in an
OL,7,Fultra-marathon race in Derbyshire,
OL,8,Fwhich organisers said made it a first
OL,9,Ffor the event in this country.
OL,11,FThe Rasselbock Backyard Ultra, in which
OL,12,Fcompetitors run a 4.16-mile course
OL,13,Fevery hour, on the hour, until only one
OL,14,Fperson is left standing, was held at
OL,15,Fthe Hardwick Estate on Saturday.
OL,17,FThere were 141 competitors, and 21% of
OL,18,Fthem were women and 79% men, and race
OL,19,Forganisers said this was the first
OL,20,Foccasion an all-female podium was
OL,21,Frecorded in the UK for a backyard
OL,22,Fultra.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
