OL,3,GNEWSATrio bag ultra-marathon's first
OL,4,Awomen-only UK podium
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatt Dillon, from Hardwick Hall, said:
OL,7,F"Given our history and connection with
OL,8,FBess of Hardwick, it feels fitting that
OL,9,Ffemale runners made their mark on the
OL,10,Fevent here."
